Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 07:44:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 70/97] Opt-in GPU timestamp census (WWE13_GPU_TIMING=1):
 per-category GPU ms/frame (scene draws, resolve, RT transfer, EDRAM dump,
 texture load, shared-memory copy, present) read after fence completion; off =
 no queries

